title: "DeepTable: Structural Attention Biases and Tree Path Encoding for Hierarchical Table Understanding"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the two modules proposed in the DeepTable paper —
  Structural Attention Bias (SAB) and Tree Path Encoding (TPE) — and their
  integration into the TableLoRA / LLaMA-Factory training pipeline.
